"/arc-plc/alabama/mobile-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025, the middle ran 57% of normal in September to October and 56% in October to November. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 219% of normal on the middle. Every grid on the page had its driest year in 1954.</p>"}
